%% Video proof lifecycle (UML state machine, informal)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Captured: in-app camera, app-private file
  Captured --> Recorded: local Drift record written
  Recorded --> Replaced: user re-records
  Replaced --> Recorded
  Recorded --> Exported: explicit Save to Photos (copy only)
  Exported --> Recorded
  Recorded --> Queued: user submits
  Queued --> Uploading: online
  Uploading --> Queued: interrupted (resume or restart)
  Uploading --> Uploaded: storage rules ok
  Uploaded --> Attached: attempt.proofIds updated
  Attached --> InReview
  InReview --> Approved
  InReview --> Rejected
  Approved --> Retained: until appeal window + retention (OD-06)
  Rejected --> Retained
  Retained --> Purged: scheduled purge, hash + decision kept
  Purged --> [*]
